   \n    <section id=\"hero\" class=\"solar-hero\">\n      <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-12\">\n          \n          <div class=\"solar-hero__copy space-y-6\">\n            <h1>\n              SOLARIDE\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"solar-hero__lead\">\n              Rooftop solar. A brighter everyday.\n            </p>\n            <p class=\"solar-hero__description\">\n              Solar panel installation for homes, businesses and farms across all of North India. With offices in Mohali and Hisar, we design systems around your site, your electricity use and your future.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 pt-4\">\n              <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://wa.me/917380280874?text=Hi%20Solaride%2C%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20solar%20panel%20solutions.\"\n                class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-[#25d366] text-white font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:bg-[#20ba5a] transition-colors duration-300 text-center\">\n                <i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp text-xl\"></i> Connect on WhatsApp\n              </a>\n              <a href=\"benefits.html\"\n                class=\"inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-white border border-neutral-300 text-neutral-700 font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors duration-300 text-center\">\n                Calculate Savings\n              </a>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"solar-hero__phone text-sm mt-3 flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#065f46] text-white text-xs\"><i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt\"></i></span>\n              Call us: <a href=\"tel:+917380280874\" class=\"font-bold hover:underline\">+91 73802 80874</a>\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"solar-hero__visual\">\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 overflow-hidden\">\n              <figure class=\"editorial-media\"><img src=\"assets/images/optimized/editorial/solar-horizon-1440.webp\" alt=\"AI-generated concept of photovoltaic panels catching morning sunlight on a North Indian rooftop\" class=\"solar-art\" width=\"1536\" height=\"864\" srcset=\"assets/images/optimized/editorial/solar-horizon-480.webp 480w, assets/images/optimized/editorial/solar-horizon-960.webp 960w, assets/images/optimized/editorial/solar-horizon-1440.webp 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 1100px, 100vw\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></figure>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <section class=\"py-20 bg-white\">\n      <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-4\">Our Services & Expertise</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-lg text-neutral-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">SOLARIDE is North India's trusted partner for premium solar energy panel sales, system design, and execution.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16\">\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-neutral-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-[#065f46] text-xl mb-6\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-solar-panel\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-3\">Solar Solutions</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Custom solar panels and systems tailored for residential, commercial, industrial, and agricultural needs.</p>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"solutions.html\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-[#065f46] font-semibold hover:underline text-sm mt-4\">\n              Explore Solutions <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ml-1.5 text-xs\"></i>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-neutral-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-[#4D9DE0] text-xl mb-6\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-chart-line\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-3\">Benefits & Savings</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Estimate electricity savings, payback and environmental impact with our solar calculator. Actual results depend on your site and tariff.</p>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"benefits.html\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-[#4D9DE0] font-semibold hover:underline text-sm mt-4\">\n              Calculate Savings <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ml-1.5 text-xs\"></i>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-neutral-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-[#1E5631] text-xl mb-6\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-users\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-3\">Meet the Team</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Backed by qualified engineering graduates from IIT Bombay and PEC Chandigarh committed to clean energy.</p>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"team.html\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-[#1E5631] font-semibold hover:underline text-sm mt-4\">\n              Meet the Experts <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ml-1.5 text-xs\"></i>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-neutral-50 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden p-8 lg:p-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n          <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center\">\n            <div class=\"md:w-1/3\">\n              <img src=\"assets/images/optimized/crowdWork-960.webp\" alt=\"Pankaj cycling roots\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/1E5631/FDB813?text=SOLARIDE+Roots'\" class=\"rounded-xl object-cover w-full h-48 md:h-64\" srcset=\"assets/images/optimized/crowdWork-480.webp 480w, assets/images/optimized/crowdWork-960.webp 960w, assets/images/optimized/crowdWork-1440.webp 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 50vw, 640px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"md:w-2/3 space-y-4\">\n              <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#065f46] uppercase bg-green-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">Our Origin Story</span>\n              <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800\">Born from a 4,000 KM Clean Energy Journey</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                In 2024, our founder Pankaj Kumar cycled solo across India from Kashmir to Kanyakumari. The mission was to spread environmental consciousness and witness India's local power needs firsthand. That same passion is what built SOLARIDE.\n              </p>\n              <button id=\"read-more-btn\" type=\"button\"\n                class=\"inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 border border-[#1E5631] text-[#1E5631] bg-white rounded-lg hover:bg-[#1E5631] hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 text-sm font-semibold\">\n                Read full cycling journey\n                \n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div id=\"story-modal\"\n        class=\"fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 z-50 flex items-center justify-center hidden\"\n        aria-modal=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg max-w-3xl w-full mx-4 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto\" role=\"dialog\"\n          aria-labelledby=\"story-modal-title\">\n          <div class=\"p-6\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-4\">\n              <h3 id=\"story-modal-title\" class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800\">The Complete Journey - 4000KM for Solar Energy</h3>\n              <button id=\"close-story-modal\" type=\"button\" class=\"text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-800\" aria-label=\"Close modal\">\n                \n              </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-600\">In the scorching summer of 2024, I, Pankaj Kumar, embarked on a 4000+ km solo journey from Kashmir to Kanyakumari to raise awareness about pollution, global warming, and the power of sustainable energy. Spanning 60 days, the expedition covered 33 cities where I engaged with students, professors, army personnel, and officials—sharing the message of clean energy.</p>\n\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-600\">Traveling 100–250 km daily, I battled heatwaves, thunderstorms, and the challenges of solo travel to ignite conversations on solar power as a viable and essential solution for a greener India.</p>\n\n              <div class=\"my-6\">\n                <img src=\"assets/images/optimized/inspirationPic-960.webp\" alt=\"Planning the journey with maps and notes\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/1E5631/FDB813?text=Planning+Journey'\" class=\"w-full h-64 object-cover rounded-lg\" srcset=\"assets/images/optimized/inspirationPic-480.webp 480w, assets/images/optimized/inspirationPic-960.webp 960w, assets/images/optimized/inspirationPic-1440.webp 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 50vw, 640px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\">\n              </div>\n\n              <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800\">The Challenges</h4>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-600\">Facing extreme weather conditions like 50°C heat and thunderstorms, the physical strain was immense. But the toughest challenge was traveling alone—managing logistics, safety, and planning every step without support.</p>\n\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-600\">I began each day at dawn to minimize heat exposure, learning resilience through every obstacle India’s summer threw at me.</p>\n\n              <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800\">The Milestones</h4>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-600\">33 cities, 60 days, and thousands of conversations later—every stop mattered.</p>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-600\">Over 60 days, I visited 33 cities and conducted sessions in schools, universities, and army camps. Every interaction—from professors in classrooms to soldiers at army bases—was a milestone.</p>\n\n              <div class=\"my-6\">\n                <img src=\"assets/images/optimized/impactPic-960.webp\" alt=\"Impact of the journey\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/1E5631/FDB813?text=Impact+of+Journey'\" class=\"w-full h-80 object-cover rounded-lg\" srcset=\"assets/images/optimized/impactPic-480.webp 480w, assets/images/optimized/impactPic-960.webp 960w, assets/images/optimized/impactPic-1440.webp 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 50vw, 640px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"902\">\n              </div>\n\n              <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800\">The Impact</h4>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-600\">My journey touched thousands of lives, sparking discussions about climate change and the role of sustainable energy. People realized that solar energy isn’t just environmentally responsible but also a smart financial decision. This momentum led to the launch of Solaride, where we now help homes and industries switch to solar.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"areas\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n      <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-10\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-3\">Serving All of North India</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-neutral-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">We install solar for homes, businesses and farms throughout North India. Mohali and Hisar are our office locations, not the limits of our service area. Contact us for a site assessment wherever you are in North India.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n          <a href=\"solar-panel-installation-mohali.html\" class=\"group block p-6 bg-neutral-50 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt text-[#065f46]\"></i>\n              <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 group-hover:text-[#065f46]\">Mohali Office</h3>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-600\">Our office in Punjab, supporting solar projects across North India. View Mohali-specific installation and net-metering information.</p>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"solar-panel-installation-hisar.html\" class=\"group block p-6 bg-neutral-50 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt text-[#065f46]\"></i>\n              <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 group-hover:text-[#065f46]\">Hisar Office</h3>\n    